  "updated_at": "2026-04-14",
  "bio": "Welcome to Tattoo Aki, Rio de Janeiro's premier destination for elegant minimalist and exquisite lettering tattoos. Located in the heart of the city at R Senador Dantas, we cater to the discerning client through appointment-only sessions, ensuring personalized attention and artistry. Embark on your bespoke ink journey with us by scheduling your visit at www.tattooaki.com.br or call (21) 97178-0445 for quotes and bookings.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rio De Janeiro, Rio De Janeiro, Brazil",
